title: There Will Never Be Another You
key: Eb
tempo: 160
style: jazz

// Thirty-two bars, ABAC. The A goes from the one to the minor six by its
// minor two-five, then makes the one a dominant on the way to the four; B
// and C both start on the four and the flat seven, and C comes home by the
// two-five from the sharp four, A half-diminished, down through G, C, F, B-flat.
